551	    /**
552	     * A user whose role may reassign (a steward, unless the permission matrix says otherwise) moves a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet. It keeps its date
553	     * and takes the next number in the sequence it would be numbered in (the sheet's, or while the sheet
554	     * numbers by period, its due-by's period's), its old number never given again (a DRAFT, having none,
555	     * gets none), loses any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new person's next
556	     * statement), and is listed as its new person's newest claim. A SETTLED or VOID claim cannot move,
557	     * nor one due inside a closed period, nor one dated after its new person's retirement date.
558	     */
